### Testdata fra InitData:
### Sal 1 (20 rækker x 12 sæder, sæde-id 1-240), Sal 2 (25 x 16, sæde-id 241-640)
### Forestilling 1 = Jaws kl. 17, 2 = Jaws kl. 20, 3 = The Notebook, 4 = Mad Max
### Billettyper: 1 = Voksen 120, 2 = Barn 80, 3 = Pensionist 95
### Booking 1 = David, sæde 1 (række 1, sæde 1) til forestilling 2

### 1. Programmet de næste 3 måneder
GET http://localhost:8080/api/showings

### 2. Film på programmet
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies

### 3. Billettyper
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ticket-types

### 4. Sædeoversigt for Jaws kl. 20 (sæde 1 er booket)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/showings/2/seats

### 5. Pris for booking 1 (forventet: total 120)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/price

### 6. Book to sæder som gæst: en voksen og et barn (forventet: 201, seatCodes ["1-2","1-3"])
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": null,
  "guestName": "Anna",
  "guestMail": "anna@email.dk",
  "showingId": 2,
  "seats": [
    { "seatId": 2, "ticketTypeId": 1 },
    { "seatId": 3, "ticketTypeId": 2 }
  ]
}

### 7. Book et sæde der allerede er taget (forventet: 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestName": "Bo",
  "guestMail": "bo@email.dk",
  "showingId": 2,
  "seats": [ { "seatId": 1, "ticketTypeId": 1 } ]
}

### 8. Book et sæde fra Sal 2 til en forestilling i Sal 1 (forventet: 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestName": "Bo",
  "guestMail": "bo@email.dk",
  "showingId": 2,
  "seats": [ { "seatId": 300, "ticketTypeId": 1 } ]
}

### 9. Pris for den nye booking (forventet: total 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2/price

### 10. Betal den
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2/pay

### 11. Billet
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/2/ticket

### 12. Opret forestilling uden login (forventet: 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/showings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "movieId": 2, "auditoriumId": 1, "startTime": "2030-01-10T19:00:00" }

### 13. Log ind som medarbejder (Mads er Clerk og Admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mads", "password": "kode123" }

### 14. Opret forestilling (forventet: 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/showings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "movieId": 2, "auditoriumId": 1, "startTime": "2030-01-10T19:00:00" }

### 15. Opret overlappende forestilling i samme sal (forventet: 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/showings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "movieId": 1, "auditoriumId": 1, "startTime": "2030-01-10T20:00:00" }

### 16. Aflys forestilling 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/showings/1/cancel

### 17. Opret ny film
POST http://localhost:8080/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Up",
  "runTime": 5760,
  "description": "Flying house",
  "director": "Pete Docter",
  "releaseYear": 2009,
  "releaseDate": "2009-05-29",
  "ageRestriction": 0,
  "genre": "ANIMATION"
}

### 18. Tag Mad Max af programmet (dens fremtidige forestillinger aflyses)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/movies/3/deactivate

### 19. Opret ny sal - sæderne laves automatisk
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auditoriums
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sal 3", "rowCount": 10, "seatsPerRow": 8 }

### 20. Registrer en ny kunde (forventet: 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lucas",
  "email": "lucas@mail.dk",
  "password": "hemmelig123",
  "birthday": "2000-01-01"
}

### 21. Log ind som kunde (forventet: 200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucas@mail.dk",
  "password": "hemmelig123"
}
